@startuml patch-manager-interest-pk
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title PATCH /api/manager/v1/interest/{pk}
caption CRB-58 · 관심 분야 이름 수정 (student_profile.interests의 옛 값은 그대로)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ParseInterestPkPipe\n+ ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminInterestController" as Controller
participant "AdminInterestService" as Service
participant "AdminInterestRepository" as AdminInterestRepository
participant "InterestService" as InterestService
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: PATCH /api/manager/v1/interest/{pk}\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>\n{ name }
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pk가 1 ~ 2147483647의 정수가 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 pk must be a positive integer.
else name이 문자열이 아님, trim 후 비었거나 50자 초과
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: updateName(pk, req)
Controller -> Service: updateName(pk, req)
group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: lockForWrite(tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: LOCK TABLE interest IN SHARE ROW EXCLUSIVE MODE
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: findByPk(pk, tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT interest WHERE pk = ?
  PostgreSQL --> AdminInterestRepository: row | 없음
  alt 없는 관심 분야
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Interest not found.
  end
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: findByName(name, tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT interest WHERE name = ?
  PostgreSQL --> AdminInterestRepository: row | 없음
  alt 다른 행이 같은 이름을 씀
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 409 This interest name already exists.
  end
  note right of Service: 자기 이름 그대로 보내면 성공 (변경 없음)
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: updateName(pk, name, tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE interest SET name WHERE pk = ? RETURNING
  PostgreSQL --> AdminInterestRepository: row
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL
  트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답.
  student_profile.interests는 문자열 복사본이라 일괄 변경하지 않음 (옛 이름이 남음)
end note
Service -> InterestService: refresh()
ref over Service, PostgreSQL: 커밋 뒤 이 인스턴스 캐시를 다시 읽음 — flow/interest-cache-bootstrap.puml\n재조회 실패는 로그만 남기고 응답은 성공
Service --> Controller: AdminInterestDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { pk, name, sort_order }

@enduml
